// expect: 42
// The effect-polymorphic absorption crossing a scheme boundary: bracket's
// row is its thunk's row read across the install's mask, generalized and
// instantiated at the caller. The caller proves `!Ping` — the subtraction
// must survive instantiation. It was measured leaking twice: once as the
// mask's absent set dropped by the substitution, and again (2026-09-24, rows
// as cells) as a reader folding a tail root's content back in, unmasked,
// after the carry had already filtered it.
// EXPECTATION TRUED (2026-09-24): this declared `with Pure`, and building the
// thunk is a construction — a closure record, `Memory + Alloc` — so Pure was
// a false claim the moment construction was charged. `!Ping` is what the
// fixture measures.
effect Ping { ping() -> Int }

handler pong {
  ping() => resume(7)
}

fn bracket(body) = body() ~> pong

fn caller() -> Int with !Ping = bracket(() => ping())

fn main() = caller() * 6
